{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57582","headline":"严君平口诀 · 无名氏","name":"严君平口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铅是铅，汞是汞，只这两般是铅汞。\n龙是龙，虎是虎，只这两个同宗祖。\n若能识此坎离宫，离宫之下出黄土。\n黄土出黄芽，黄芽之下金花成。\n金花成，金花之下结紫精。\n紫精成，紫精之下出白金。\n白金沉，黄金浮，世人采沉作丹头，搜取赤髓相和种。\n种有时，采有日，换筋骨，添寿历，天仙地仙不思议。\n点铅铁，兼瓦砾，一二三四五，水火木金土。\n但知明此诀，便是长生路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}